<% layout('layouts/base') %>

<main class="about">
  <h1>About</h1>
	<div class="grid about-head">
		<div>
		<p>Howdy, glad you're here. My name is Tim and I'm a software developer living on an island off the westcoast of Canada.</p>
		<p>I love building software for the internet, and making products that improve people's lives. I'm a full stack developer, but specialize on platform and API development.</p>
		<p>Previously, I worked at Slack and helped develop their integrations, platform and API, allowing millions of users to connect and collaborate more effectively.</p>
		<p>I'm always interested in hearing of what you're building, so feel free to hit me up on <a href="www.linkedin.com/in/tlef" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> or <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/tlef.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BlueSky</a> to start a conversation.</p>
		</div>
		<div>
			<img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="Tim Lefler's Avatar" class="author-avatar">
		</div>
	</div>
</main>
